# Discord knowledge pull: commit text + LFS-eligible binaries (pdf/skp/zip); keep raw images
# LOCAL-ONLY — png/jpg aren't LFS-tracked (.gitattributes is frozen) and total ~200MB. Re-pull via
# scripts/discord_ingest.py. Distilled numbers already live in the committed vault files.
knowledge/_inbox/discord/**/*.png
knowledge/_inbox/discord/**/*.jpg
knowledge/_inbox/discord/**/*.jpeg
knowledge/_inbox/discord/**/*.rar
